### Generate presigned POST URL and fields with createPresignedPost

Source: https://github.com/aws/aws-sdk-js-v3/blob/main/packages/s3-presigned-post/README.md

Creates the target upload URL and form fields required for a POST request. Values in Fields must satisfy specified Conditions, and Expires defaults to 3600 seconds.

```typescript
const client = new S3Client({ region: "us-west-2" });
const Bucket = "johnsmith";
const Key = "user/eric/1";
const Fields = {
  acl: "bucket-owner-full-control",
};
const { url, fields } = await createPresignedPost(client, {
  Bucket,
  Key,
  Conditions,
  Fields,
  Expires: 600, //Seconds before the presigned post expires. 3600 by default.
});
```

